Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: taskmgr: Scale tab pages, status bar parts, columns and graphs to the DPI.
 The tab page position, the status bar part widths, the list column
 widths, and the CPU and memory meters and history graphs were laid out
 in fixed pixels, so at a higher DPI the pages were small inside the
 window and the texts were cut. Scale these sizes with one helper,
 scale_dpi(); 96 DPI is unchanged.
Last-Modified: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 14:50:00 +0300

